					<description><![CDATA[<p>&#160;</p>
<p><strong>Pack Contents</strong></p>
<p>Blade roasts<br />
Oyster sliced<br />
Briskets<br />
Chuck sliced<br />
Scotch/ ribeye sliced<br />
Ribs<br />
Fillet sliced<br />
Round sliced<br />
Rump sliced<br />
Silverside stir fry<br />
Topside roasts<br />
Osso bucco<br />
Mince<br />
Sausages<br />
Diced beef<br />
Gravy beef</p>
<p>Bones and Trim are weighed in the final Weight. which is about 30%</p>
